  "description": "Current user-selected local wire: flat guest input/envelope journey fields preferred; new source success response {success:true,data:{source_system:HAVEN,...}}, plain versioned HAVEN callback, photo signing photo_reference/photo_version. Internal authentication/storage remain HAVEN. Runtime invariants apply. No hosted origin exists.",
