    "Canonical schemas intentionally reject unknown request properties; runtime strips some unknown fields. Authentication source is bound by credential, never caller JSON.",
    "IDs cannot be literal . or ... Phones are normalized to E.164. Trimmed required text is well formed, nonempty and control-free; notes reject NUL.",
