    "Fleet stores the supplied photo version and does not auto-increment on contact updates. Client must increase it for photo changes/removal; monotonic profile photo versions are not currently enforced by Fleet.",
    "Do not mix nested traveler and flat guest fields, or request journey/leg and envelope round_trip_reference/leg_kind. Journey/leg are paired; existing identity cannot change.",
    "Both acceptance flags describe committed storage. New source successes wrap a HAVEN snapshot under data. Old immutable responses/events, including plain PMS bodies, replay exactly; use current source lookup for recovery.",
    "id and fleet_reference equal original fleet_request_id as a string; both external IDs match; driver.name equals assignment.driver_name.",
    "Tracking needs active current assignment, actual nonblank plate, approved HTTPS origin, finite expiry and matching assignment references. No passenger contacts/photos are public.",
    "Renewal rotates old token and queues a higher request_version, preserves assignment UUID and cannot revive revoked/terminal sharing. Exact event replay returns its saved result.",
    "Signing uses a server-derived assignment UUID. Haven authorizes guest photo permission; returned URL must match approved origin and expire within 120 seconds."
